    <h1 class="atit">Is HipoBuy <em>legitiem</em>?<br>Nederland · Douane &amp; escrow</h1>
    <p class="aint">HipoBuy is een Chinese inkoopagent (Weidian / Taobao / 1688). Deze NL-desk beantwoordt „is HipoBuy legitiem?” met escrow + lokale Douane/PostNL-context — geen tweede spreadsheet-hub.</p>
  <p class="hub-uplink" data-nl-deepen="20261028" data-step4-hub="1">Merk / Spreadsheet / Coupons / Dataset → <a href="https://hipobuyspreadsheet.net/">hipobuyspreadsheet.net</a> · <a href="https://hipobuyspreadsheet.net/hipobuy-coupons/">coupons</a> · <a href="https://hipobuyspreadsheet.net/finds-dataset/">dataset</a> (Independent Index · 8,600+). Deze URL = NL lokaal (NL-postcode <code>1234 AB</code> · Douane · PostNL).</p>
  
<section id="local" class="local-box" data-nl-fingerprint="legit-nl-douane-1234ab" data-nl-deepen="20261028">
<h2>NL-fingerprint bij „is HipoBuy legitiem?”</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Escrow ≠ Douane</strong> — escrow dekt de agent; invoer volgt de geboekte lijn (Tax free / Prepaid Duty / Duties Payable by Recipient).</li>
<li><strong>Adres</strong> — postcode <code>1234 AB</code>; verkeerd land = verkeerde last mile.</li>
<li><strong>Last mile</strong> — PostNL/DHL op de live SKU; deze desk opent geen ticket.</li>
<li><strong>Bron</strong> — <a href="https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/nl/douane/douane" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Belastingdienst Douane</a>; verzending: <a href="/hipobuy-shipping-guide/">shipping guide</a>.</li>
</ol>
<p>Globale spreadsheet / coupons / dataset → <a href="https://hipobuyspreadsheet.net/">hipobuyspreadsheet.net</a> (8,600+).</p>
</section>

  </header>
  <div class="verd fade-in-d">
    <div class="vi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="20" height="20"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
    <div><p class="vlb">Ons oordeel</p><p class="vt">Ja — HipoBuy is legitiem; Douane volgt je NL-lijn</p>
    <p class="vd">Hipobuy operates on the same trusted escrow model as Kakobuy and CNFans, with equivalent buyer protections. We rate it <strong>4.3 / 5 overall</strong>. Read on for the full breakdown.</p></div>
  </div>
