  <h2 class="ph" id="score">Trust score breakdown</h2>
  <p class="pp">We evaluated Hipobuy across six dimensions based on platform features, buyer protection policy and community-reported experiences.</p>
  <div class="scard">
    <div class="sch"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>Hipobuy Spreadsheet NL Trust Score &mdash; Hipobuy</div>
    <div class="scr"><span class="scl">Payment security</span><div class="sbw"><div class="sbf" style="width:90%"></div></div><span class="scv">9/10</span></div><div class="scr"><span class="scl">Order accuracy</span><div class="sbw"><div class="sbf" style="width:80%"></div></div><span class="scv">8/10</span></div><div class="scr"><span class="scl">Customer support</span><div class="sbw"><div class="sbf" style="width:80%"></div></div><span class="scv">8/10</span></div><div class="scr"><span class="scl">QC photo quality</span><div class="sbw"><div class="sbf" style="width:85%"></div></div><span class="scv">8.5/10</span></div><div class="scr"><span class="scl">Shipping options</span><div class="sbw"><div class="sbf" style="width:75%"></div></div><span class="scv">7.5/10</span></div><div class="scr"><span class="scl">Refund handling</span><div class="sbw"><div class="sbf" style="width:70%"></div></div><span class="scv">7/10</span></div>
    <div class="sct"><span class="sctl">Overall Trust Score</span><span class="sctv">4.3 / 5</span></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="ph" id="procon">Pros and cons</h2>
  <div class="pgrid">
    <div class="pcol pro"><p class="phd">&#10003; Pros</p><ul class="pli"><li>Escrow payment — funds held until you confirm delivery</li><li>Free QC photos before international shipping</li><li>Competitive service fees on Hipobuy</li><li>DHL, EMS and economy lines to UK, EU and US</li><li>Supports Weidian, Taobao and 1688 links</li><li>W2C Links spreadsheet with curated finds</li></ul></div>
    <div class="pcol con"><p class="phd">&#10007; Cons</p><ul class="pli"><li>Smaller community than legacy agents</li><li>Customs risk on high-value parcels</li><li>Economy lines have limited tracking</li><li>Refund timelines vary by seller</li></ul></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="ph" id="protection">Buyer protection &amp; refunds</h2>
  <p class="pp">Hipobuy uses an <strong>escrow payment model</strong> &mdash; your money is held until you confirm receipt. This applies to every order without exception.</p>
  <ul class="pul">
    <li><strong>Wrong item received</strong> &mdash; full refund or re-purchase</li>
    <li><strong>QC rejection</strong> &mdash; reject after photos for a return and wallet refund</li>
    <li><strong>Lost parcel</strong> &mdash; covered by shipping insurance (purchase at checkout)</li>
    <li><strong>Damaged on arrival</strong> &mdash; file dispute within 7 days of delivery</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="cb warn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg><div><strong>Always buy shipping insurance for orders over $40</strong><p>Without insurance, Hipobuy has limited liability for parcels lost on economy lines. Insurance typically costs $1&ndash;3 and covers lost or damaged parcels.</p></div></div>
  <h2 class="ph" id="verdict">Final verdict</h2>
  <p class="pp"><strong>Is Hipobuy legit? Yes.</strong> It operates on the same escrow-based model as established agents with the same core buyer protections. Gebruik de hub-<a href="https://hipobuyspreadsheet.net/">spreadsheet / Independent Index</a> voor catalogus, onze <a href="/hipobuy-shipping-guide/">shipping guide</a> voor NL-porto, and message us on <a href="https://wa.me/8615396628356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> for specific advice.</p>
  <div class="cb tip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg><div><strong>Questions about a specific order?</strong><p>Message us on <a href="https://wa.me/8615396628356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp +86 153 9662 8356</a> &mdash; we advise on agent selection, QC and disputes daily.</p></div></div>
  
<h2 class="ph" id="nl-legit-douane">Legitiem voor een Nederlands adres</h2>
<p class="pp"><strong>Is HipoBuy legitiem?</strong> Voor NL-kopers: escrow dekt de agent; <strong>Douane/BTW</strong> volgt de lijn (Tax free · Prepaid Duty · Duties Payable by Recipient). Gebruik postcode <strong>1234 AB</strong> en check PostNL/DHL op de live SKU. Dit desk is infosite — geen account, geen porto, geen ticket.</p>
<p class="pp">Globale catalogus / spreadsheet / coupons → hub <a href="https://hipobuyspreadsheet.net/">hipobuyspreadsheet.net</a>. Lokale verzending: <a href="/hipobuy-shipping-guide/">shipping guide</a>.</p>

<h2 class="ph" id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage"><div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">Is Hipobuy legit?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Yes. Hipobuy is a legitimate buying agent with escrow payment protection, free QC photos and a buyer protection policy covering wrong items, QC rejections and lost parcels (with insurance).</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">Is Hipobuy safe to use?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Hipobuy is generally safe. Payments are held in escrow until you confirm receipt. QC photos let you inspect items before they ship internationally. Always purchase shipping insurance for orders over $40.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">Is Hipobuy a scam?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">No. Hipobuy is not a scam. It operates on the same trusted model as other reputable agents — escrow payments, free QC and buyer dispute resolution. Occasional issues occur on any platform, but the buyer protection policy covers most situations.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How does Hipobuy compare to Kakobuy?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Both are legitimate agents with similar fees (0–5%), free QC photos, and DHL/EMS/economy shipping. The main differences are community size and interface design. Check both platforms before placing large orders.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">Does Hipobuy have buyer protection?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Yes. Hipobuy uses escrow payments, offers QC rejection before shipping, allows returns to the warehouse, and provides a dispute resolution process for post-delivery issues.</div>
  </div>
</div></div>
</main>
